---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/ui/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const updated = '13 August 2026';
---

<Layout
  title={`Terms of use | ${SITE.name}`}
  description={`Terms of use for the ${SITE.name} website and Google Ads / Meta Ads management services.`}
>
  <div class="container"><Breadcrumbs crumbs={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Terms of use' }]} /></div>

  <article class="section legal">
    <div class="container legal-inner">
      <h1>Terms of use</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <section>
        <h2>1. Acceptance of terms</h2>
        <p>By using the {SITE.name} website ({SITE.url}), you agree to these Terms of Use. If you don't agree, please don't use the site.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>2. Services</h2>
        <p>{SITE.legalName} provides Google Ads and Meta Ads consulting and management. The scope, deliverables, fees, and terms of any engagement are set out in a separate service agreement between {SITE.legalName} and the client. These website terms don't constitute a service agreement on their own.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>3. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>All content on this website — text, images, and code — belongs to {SITE.legalName} or its licensors. You may not reproduce or distribute it without written permission.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>4. No guarantee of results</h2>
        <p>Ad performance depends on factors outside our control — your product, pricing, competition, and market conditions among them. Nothing on this site is a guarantee of specific results. Figures used as examples (cost-per-click, lead volume) illustrate mechanisms, not promised outcomes.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>5. Disclaimer of warranties</h2>
        <p>This website is provided "as is," without warranties of any kind. We don't warrant that it will be error-free or continuously available.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>6. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p>To the extent permitted by law, {SITE.legalName} isn't liable for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this website or our services. Our total liability in any circumstance won't exceed the amount paid to us in the preceding one month.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>7. Third-party links</h2>
        <p>This site links to third-party services (Google, WhatsApp, and similar). We have no control over, and accept no responsibility for, their content or practices.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>8. Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Disputes are subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Delhi, India.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>9. Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the site after changes means you accept the revised terms.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`} class="accent-underline">{SITE.email}</a></p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-inner { max-width: 42rem; }
  .legal h1 { margin-block: 0.6rem 0.4rem; }
  .legal-updated { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .legal section { padding-block: 1.75rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .legal section:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
  .legal h2 { font-size: var(--fs-h3); margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .legal p { color: var(--muted); font-size: var(--fs-sm); max-width: none; }
</style>
